# Changelog

## 2.0.0

### Breaking changes

- **The package is now ESM-only.** Output is published as an ES module
  (`"type": "module"`) with a single `import` entry in `exports`. CommonJS
  `require('react-pdf-hook')` is no longer supported — consume it with `import`,
  or use a dynamic `import()` from a CommonJS context.

### Changed

- Build tooling migrated from `tsc` to [tsdown](https://tsdown.dev). The
  published bundle now lives in `dist/` (`dist/index.js`, `dist/index.d.ts`)
  with source maps included. `tsc` is retained for type-checking only
  (`npm run typecheck`).
- `pdfjs-dist` is now declared as an optional peer dependency. It is required
  only if you consume the exported `pdfjs-dist` types; the runtime bundle does
  not depend on it.
